        "description": "Analyze actual images and return grounded generation directions in language, not generated media or a stock template library. Canvas source layers precede ordered independent reference assets; duplicate effective image inputs (asset plus crop) are rejected. product-scene accepts 1–16 canvas sources, analyzes the first and accepts no independent references; scene-video requires exactly one combined image; multi-shot analyzes 1–4 combined images and returns plain-text multi-shot directions for action video, not editable storyboard scenes or local composition. Returns at most 8 candidates with server-assigned id, title (200), description (2000) and prompt (8000 characters); an empty candidates array is normal. Nonempty results are cached only in the active instance by document, ordered asset IDs and source crop rectangles, kind and language; refresh bypasses that cache. May incur model charges; dismissing a recommendation does not revoke accepted model work.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["documentId", "sourceLayerIds", "kind", "language"],
